    },
    "主屏幕和锁屏替你数着那一天，\n演出的歌也能提前听熟。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Home and Lock Screens count down to the day,\nand you can learn the songs before you go."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主畫面和鎖定畫面替你數著那一天，\n演出的歌也能提前聽熟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路线、天气、开场时间一眼就有；\n音乐节按舞台看下一位。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Directions, weather, and start time at a glance.\nAt festivals, see who's next on each stage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "路線、天氣、開場時間一眼就有；\n音樂節按舞台看下一位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "给这一晚打个分，\n照片和小记一起收进足迹。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rate the night,\nthen keep photos and notes together in Footprints."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "給這一晚打個分，\n照片和小記一起收進足跡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "粘贴购票平台的链接，\n名称、时间和地点会自动填好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paste a link from your ticketing platform,\nand the name, time, and venue fill in for you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "貼上購票平台的連結，\n名稱、時間和地點會自動填好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下一场，从这里开始倒数" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Next Countdown Starts Here"
